<<<< once
      <h3>The ring</h3>
      <p>Sixteen cells form a ring, numbered clockwise from 01 in the top-left corner: 01 to 06 across the top, 07 to 09 down the right, 10 to 14 back along the bottom and 15 to 16 up the left. Cell 01 is the warden's office. Every run starts there, and nothing is ever held in it, so the other 15 cells hold the prisoners. A run starts with 4 inmates already out on random cells (3 in about 1 run in 20), and the rest sealed. The lantern marks where the warden stands.</p>
====
      <h3>環形監區</h3>
      <p>十六個格子圍成一圈，從左上角的01號開始順時針編號：上排01到06，右側往下07到09，下排往回10到14，左側往上15到16。01號是審訊室，每一局都從這裡出發，而且這裡永遠不關任何東西，所以囚犯都關在其他15間牢房裡。每局開始時，已有4隻囚犯出現在隨機的牢房裡（約每20局有1局只有3隻），其餘牢房都上鎖。提燈標示典獄長目前所在的位置。</p>
>>>>

<<<< once
      <h3>A day on the block</h3>
====
      <h3>監區的一天</h3>
>>>>

<<<< once
        <li><strong>Patrol.</strong> Each morning offers three destination cells from the next six clockwise from the warden. They glow on the ring and appear as cards under it. A destination can be a locked cell, which opens when the warden arrives, a cell whose inmate you already know, or the warden's office, which comes up less often than a cell (about 1 morning in 4 when it's in reach). You can't see inside a locked cell until it opens. You must patrol before anything else.</li>
====
        <li><strong>巡視。</strong>每天早上，會從典獄長順時針方向往前的六格中提供三個目的地。它們會在環形監區上發光，並以卡片顯示在下方。目的地可能是未開啟的牢房（典獄長抵達時就會打開）、已知囚犯的牢房，或審訊室（審訊室出現的機率比一般牢房低：在範圍內時，大約每4個早上出現1次）。未開啟的牢房在打開前看不到裡面。每天一定要先巡視，才能做其他事。</li>
>>>>

<<<< once
        <li><strong>The office.</strong> When the warden walks to the office, choose one: <strong>Instigate</strong> puts a new special event on a random cell, behind a locked door or beside an inmate (2 when the board has none), and <strong>Bestow</strong> raises 1 random inmate on the block a tier.</li>
====
        <li><strong>審訊室。</strong>典獄長走到審訊室時，二選一：<strong>煽動</strong>會在隨機一間牢房放上一個新的獄中事變，可能在未開啟的門後，也可能在囚犯旁邊（盤面上沒有任何事變時放2個）；<strong>賞賜</strong>會讓監區上隨機1隻囚犯升一階。</li>
