      <h3>Objectives, tools and the Warden's Treasure</h3>
      <p>Every drill starts with a pick of three random tools, as the live game does: take one, and it lasts for the whole run. As in the live game's offers, the eight named for a beast (Berserk Lion, Mammoth, Alpha Wolf, Colossal Rat) come up only about an eighth as often as the others. Each run also draws a random objective, shown with the run's goal: <strong>King of the Caged</strong> (at least 1 inmate's rarity reaches Supreme) or <strong>Prison Walk</strong> (move 18 tiles: every cell the warden walks counts). Meeting it earns a tool: pick one of three, and it lasts for the rest of the run. So a Supreme earns a tool only in runs whose objective is King of the Caged. The live game has more objectives, and what they pay isn't known yet, so every objective here pays a tool.</p>
      <p>Each Rainbow that reaches the vault opens the Warden's Treasure: pick one gift, which takes effect at once. In the Lab you can change how many tools a drill starts with, or switch rewards off for pure rules practice.</p>
====
      <h3>目標、刑具與典獄長的珍藏</h3>
      <p>和正式遊戲一樣，每次練習開始時會從三個隨機刑具中選一個，效果持續整局。也和正式遊戲的選項一樣，八個帶有野獸名稱的刑具（狂獅、巨象、頭狼、碩鼠）出現機率只有其他刑具的約八分之一。每局也會隨機抽一個目標，和本局目標一起顯示：<strong>困獸稱王</strong>（至少1隻囚犯的稀有度達到至臻）或<strong>巡獄之路</strong>（移動18格：典獄長走過的每一格都算）。達成後可獲得一個刑具：三選一，效果持續到本局結束。所以只有在目標是困獸稱王的局，做出至臻才會拿到刑具。正式遊戲還有更多目標，目前還不清楚它們的獎勵，所以這裡每個目標的獎勵都是刑具。</p>
      <p>每有一隻綺彩進入收容區，就會開啟典獄長的珍藏：選一個珍藏，立即生效。在實驗室裡可以調整練習開局的刑具數量，或關閉獎勵，專心練習規則。</p>
