      <h3>The trainer</h3>
      <p>Press <strong>Trainer</strong> at the top to show it beside the block while you play. It works in every situation: patrols, events, consumes, Replaces, tools and gifts.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Recommended.</strong> The trained strategy's pick appears at once, with its reason and the lesson training found for that kind of decision. The recommended cell or button is marked on the board.</li>
        <li><strong>Live check.</strong> Every option you have right now is played out hundreds of times from the current position. Everything you can't see is re-rolled each time, so it never peeks behind a door, and the trained strategy makes every later choice. Options are ranked by Rainbows vaulted by the end of the run. Each option is compared with the best on the same dice, and once the check finds a clearly better move, that becomes the recommendation. Consume options also show their exact chain odds.</li>
        <li><strong>Grades.</strong> Each move you make is graded against the live check of the position before it: the best move, close to the best (within the margin of error), or what it cost. The panel keeps a tally for the run.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>For the big picture before you play, read the <a href="strategy.html">strategy guide</a>. To get advice on your own board in the live game, open the <a href="analyze.html">board analyzer</a>: set every cell and your tools, and it recommends the move the same way the trainer does.</p>
====
      <h3>教練</h3>
      <p>按上方的<strong>教練</strong>，遊玩時就會在監區旁顯示。它適用於所有情況：巡視、獄中事變、吞噬、替換、刑具和珍藏。</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>建議動作。</strong>訓練出的策略會立即給出選擇，附上理由，以及訓練中針對這類決策得出的心得。建議的牢房或按鈕會在盤面上標示出來。</li>
        <li><strong>即時檢驗。</strong>從目前局面出發，把你現在的每個選項各模擬數百次。每次都會重骰所有你看不到的東西，所以絕不會偷看門後，之後的每個選擇則交給訓練出的策略。選項依本局結束時送進收容區的綺彩數排名。每個選項都和最佳選項用相同的骰子比較，一旦檢驗找到明顯更好的動作，就會改為建議它。吞噬選項還會顯示精確的連鎖機率。</li>
