      <p>There's no AI involved: the strategy is a set of scoring rules whose weights were tuned over millions of simulated runs. Its main lessons: consume whenever you can (unless it would break a prey mark, which gives free tiers every morning), replace a low-tier inmate in the warden's cell (Normal and Magic; Rare too when you have tools) when no consume there is worth more, since a day has one or the other, accept Chain reactions, Behind Closed Doors, Ravenous Appetite, High-Risk Convict, Crow Whispers, Taste of Freedom and the Usurpations, accept an Execution when it gains more than it removes, and keep opening doors. A Wolf or a Rat waiting at a tier feeds two of the four beasts a chain's eater can re-roll into, a Lion or a Mammoth one, and a Mammoth, a Rat and a Lion or a Wolf together keep any chain going. Held from day 1, the best instruments were the Elephant-Foot Maul, the Blood-Stained Trap and the Iron Crown of the Prison King, and the Severed Iron Maiden with Hangman's Noose turns most Replaces into Rainbows. The Squirming Iron Box hurt the most, then the Forged Key and the Gaoler's Execution Axe, and the Iron Pestle, the Searing Branding Iron and the Short-Chained Shackles came out level with no instrument.</p>

      <h3>Practice values</h3>
      <p>The live game's exact odds, daily limits and some timing details are not public. This simulator uses stated practice values for them. You can change the drill values in the Lab. Riots, followers, loot and combat are not simulated.</p>
====
      <p>這裡沒有用到 AI：策略是一套評分規則，權重是經過數百萬局模擬調整出來的。主要心得：能吞噬就吞噬（除非會破壞獵物標記，因為它每天早上都會白送升階）；當典獄長牢房裡沒有更值得的吞噬時，替換那裡的低階囚犯（普通和魔法；有刑具時稀有也算），因為每天只能二選一；接受連鎖反應、暗箱操作、飢腸轆轆、高危罪犯、鴉之低語、自由的滋味和各階僭越；處刑效率只在獲得比移除的多時才接受；並且持續開門。某個階級上等著的一隻頭狼或碩鼠，能餵飽連鎖吞噬者可能重骰成的四種野獸中的兩種，狂獅或巨象則只能餵一種；而同時有巨象、碩鼠，再加上狂獅或頭狼，任何連鎖都能接下去。從第1天就持有的情況下，最強的刑具是象腳重錘、染紅的捕獸夾和牢中王的鐵冠，而切開的人形棺搭配絞首繩能讓大部分替換變成綺彩。蠕動鐵盒傷害最大，其次是偽造鑰匙和獄卒的行刑巨斧；鐵杵、灼痛的烙鐵和短鏈腳鐐的表現則和沒有刑具差不多。</p>

      <h3>練習數值</h3>
      <p>正式遊戲的精確機率、每日上限和部分時機細節並未公開，本模擬器對這些項目使用標明的練習數值。你可以在實驗室修改練習數值。暴動、追隨者、掉寶和戰鬥都不在模擬範圍內。</p>
