      <p>A free English practice tool for the Tartarus prison season of <em>Torchlight: Infinite</em>. Use it to learn the patrol ring, the food chain, rarity climbs, events and markers before you play the season.</p>
      <p>This began as an English translation of the Chinese fan simulator <a href="https://torchlightskill.com/talos/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">塔羅斯监狱 (Talos Prison)</a> by 爱玩游戏的吉吉罗, and its board layout follows the original. The rules in this version have since been updated to match the video reveal, so it now differs heavily from the Chinese sim. Rules changed after the reveal include the warden's office in cell 01, patrol choices from the six cells ahead, no scouting, and one consume a day from the warden's cell, with chains that can't be stopped.</p>
      <p>This English version was rebuilt independently with its own code and artwork, and the original author is not involved. No code, images or audio from that tool were copied.</p>
